{"nodes": [{"id": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00601", "label": "Test Frame 00601 - PIR Camera Colour Night View with Brooder", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00601.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Colour CCTV still from the 1080P-IPC-PIR channel, timestamped 2022-02-27 23:43:19. Several hundred white mid-growth broilers pack the litter floor; two grey feed pipes with red-topped pan feeders cross the frame, a glowing brooder/heater unit sits at the right edge, and a large red drinker appears at lower left."}, {"id": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00601_camera_1080p_ipc_pir", "label": "Camera Channel 1080P-IPC-PIR", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00601.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The PIR channel supplies full-colour frames even at 23:43, implying artificial house lighting rather than IR mode. It contributes the highest-density scenes in the test set and is the only channel whose frames include a visible heat source."}, {"id": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00601_brooder_heater_zone", "label": "Brooder / Heater Attraction Zone", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00601.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A grey housing with a bright orange glowing element occupies the right edge of every PIR frame. Birds crowd noticeably tighter along its perimeter, so proximity to the heat source is a confounder for any density-based welfare metric: clustering there indicates thermal seeking, not distress."}, {"id": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00601_resting_huddle_behavior", "label": "Resting / Sitting Huddle Behaviour", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00601.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Most birds in the night PIR frames are crouched with legs tucked and bodies pressed together, forming an almost continuous white carpet. Sitting birds present a compact rounded blob with no visible neck or legs, a markedly different appearance signature from the elongated standing/feeding posture, which is why a behaviour classifier needs both postures represented."}, {"id": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00601_high_stocking_density", "label": "High Stocking Density Scene", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00601.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Bird count per frame is an order of magnitude higher than in the Siren frames and litter is barely visible in the upper half. Extreme crowd density is the stress case for detection: individual instances merge into one texture, so NMS thresholds tuned on sparse frames will collapse neighbouring birds into single boxes."}, {"id": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00601_red_pan_feeder", "label": "Red-Topped Pan Feeder Unit", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00601.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The colour channels show the same pan feeders as the Siren channel but with saturated red cone tops and white cages. The strong red hue is the single most salient non-bird colour in the scene and acts as a reliable anchor for registering feeder positions in colour frames."}, {"id": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00601_timestamp_overlay_metadata", "label": "Burned-In Timestamp and Channel Name Overlay", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00601.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every frame carries a white top-right date-time stamp and a top-left channel label rendered by the DVR. This is the only per-frame provenance available (there is no sidecar metadata), so it is what lets frames be grouped into recording sessions and ordered in time - but it is also fixed high-contrast text that a detector may latch onto as a spurious feature."}], "edges": [{"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00601", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00601_camera_1080p_ipc_pir", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00601.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00601", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00601_brooder_heater_zone", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00601.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00601", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00601_resting_huddle_behavior", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00601.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00601", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00601_high_stocking_density", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00601.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00601", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00601_red_pan_feeder", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00601.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00601", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00601_timestamp_overlay_metadata", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00601.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00601_brooder_heater_zone", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00601_resting_huddle_behavior", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "Chick